Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, look, it's today's newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.86,0:01:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have a big report on Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't leave us hanging.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, tell us what it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.94,0:01:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That article is going\Nto decide all our fates.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing much to say, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't mention us at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.74,0:01:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, it doesn't mention us? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:01:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a single word?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:01:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.32,0:02:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to have to live\Nthe rest of my life as a fugitive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.44,0:02:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Franky family really\Nwrecked up the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.30,0:02:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe your grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like he pulled some strings and told the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,government that they were\Njust innocent bystanders?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, that's too complicated for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what Luffy said!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be how Kiji's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a strange man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, that's good for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, we're criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.24,0:02:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I would hate to see\Nanyone get wrapped up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in this mess and have\Ntheir whole lives ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, good thing you feel that way,\Nbecause they had plenty to say about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.34,0:02:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A declaration of war on\Nthe world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They even blame us for\Nburning down the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.82,0:02:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guarantee our bounties are going to\Ngo through the roof after this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, does that mean I'll\Nfinally get a bounty? Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll probably get something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:03:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But mine's going to be\Nthe big one this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.66,0:03:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bright star appears, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you excited about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrible news!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.58,0:03:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg's here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're really doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to fight about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.82,0:03:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you'd like, I could help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're probably just here\Nto mess with my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been dismantling so long,\NI'm afraid your skills have dulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me your blueprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.56,0:03:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A reunion for Tom's workers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you old pros have\Nroom for a couple of rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Galley-La Company is ready to go! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's build the Straw Hats a ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:03:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're probably itching\Nto get off this island,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we figured you could use a little help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I thought you\Nwere repairing the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.66,0:04:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were, but when we heard you were\Nbuilding a new ship for the Straw Hats,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone packed up their stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and ran here as fast as they could.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.72,0:04:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys, of course I'm happy to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They really touched my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.96,0:04:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now hop to it, no slack at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.29,0:04:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's show him what the Dock\None for him and I made him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankie's building us a ship and\Nwe don't even have to pay for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were asleep when he said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.95,0:04:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess Frankie's not a jerk after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankie's a nice guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see how it turns out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.31,0:04:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can use the rest of our money\Nto buy supplies for the voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope this one's equipped\Nwith a weight room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:04:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as it has cannons, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to our 100\Nmillion berries? Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already spent it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We needed to buy lots of\Nmeat and booze for the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spent it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You spent all of my money?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.78,0:05:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, everyone was really hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you spend so much on food?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's hardly anything left!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.94,0:05:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course there isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole town was partying with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they didn't go home\Nuntil morning, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure was fun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since the ship's free, we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.06,0:05:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So no worries, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted nice\Nfurniture for this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.90,0:05:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can still check out the resale shops.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I have some of\Nthat money to go play with?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.82,0:05:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd sooner take it to the grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your allowance is revoked!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for giving me this\Ndelicious water water candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.65,0:06:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not share it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With what's left over, I\Nwant to buy a medical book.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd repair your\Nsword for that pathetic amount!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come up with some more money or forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cranky old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.03,0:06:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A couple of water, water candies, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it. I must say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That BBQ yesterday was the\Nbest I've had in ages. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.10,0:06:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd expect no less that you\Nuse the best ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.86,0:06:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, the best will do. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Grocer Guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.26,0:07:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna head on back\Nand meet up with Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.06,0:07:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay. Good night. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.74,0:07:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to rejoin your crew, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be rough without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not around, things really\Nstart to fall apart, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, if you insist, I'll\Nrejoin the Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that does seem to be\Nthe best way to go about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that makes 23 scenarios.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice weather we're having, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go fishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, care to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.12,0:07:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.32,0:07:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's always the\Njust pretend like nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happened and hop on\Nboard the ship strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.26,0:07:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided to set out on\Nmy own and visit Elbaph.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need you to stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totally understand not wanting\Nto live your lives without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, does that mean you're staying, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I will, dummies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I didn't know anybody could love\Nsomeone as much as you guys love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.12,0:08:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's he doing? What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, young one, I need you over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking nice, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep up the good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it warms my heart to see those\Ntwo working together for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're watching, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.04,0:08:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a rocky road without you,\Nbut your boys are doing you proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.64,0:08:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might have left us,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.72,0:09:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but watching these two right now is like\Nseeing the ship you built come alive again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's finally set.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the Log Pose is\Npointing to the next island!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's left is to get our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.78,0:09:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see the ship myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.52,0:09:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Franky said no peeking\Nuntil he's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.16,0:09:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, guys, you know\Nwhere that log is pointing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might come as a big surprise\Nif you're not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I don't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.80,0:09:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, it kind of\Nlooks like it's pointing down a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because where it's pointing\Nis on the bottom of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're finally going to\NFishman Island? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Sanji's acting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.50,0:10:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's tricky. Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.40,0:10:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that going to be tough after\Nwhat happened in your village?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not all fishmen are going to\Ngive us trouble like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.33,0:10:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody knows Fishman Island is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.16,0:10:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Zoro, and he's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island is one of the most\Nfamous spots on the whole Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.58,0:10:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beautiful mermaids leap and dive, painting\Nthe water with their elegant tailpits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you can frolic with the fish\Nand make all your dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.32,0:10:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me out, Nino!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I'm not hurting anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, there's young mermaids, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, even if the\Nplace is nice to visit,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that don't mean it's easy\Nfor people to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume that was the case, since\Nit's at the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.70,0:10:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, we'll figure it out on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, on the way is a problem, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.12,0:10:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look at today's\Npaper and you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:10:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.80,0:11:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fourteen ships have disappeared this\Nmonth alone, all in the same place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.90,0:11:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They call that patch of water\Nthe Florian Triangle. Anyways,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you won't be making it to Fishman Island\Nuntil after you sail through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every year, over 100 ships go missing in\Nthat area, and nobody has a clue as to why.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's spooky?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that later?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They show up totally empty without\Na single crew member in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Other people say they found\Nghost ships with crews
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dead men wandering\Nthe ocean lost in a haze.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.14,0:11:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean they're like zombies? Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hanging out with a bunch\Nof skeletons sounds cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hanging out with some\Nimagination you've got. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.80,0:11:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No ghost ships for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're passing straight through that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what really happens in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.76,0:11:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, nobody ever comes out of\Nthere alive, and dead men tell no tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water is dark, the fog is thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.02,0:12:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It swallows you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Many a soul has been sacrificed\Nto that treacherous sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you better be darn ready before\Nyou even think of setting sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although some people do\Ncall them ghost ships,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,abandoned vessels are often\Ncalled treasure ships too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're more likely to find a ship\Nfilled with riches than the undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.73,0:12:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put time down those ghost ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but I don't want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stock up on plenty of food and water\Nbefore we go, so even if we do get lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.54,0:12:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.45,0:12:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A treasure ship, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.94,0:12:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they have swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, pirate people!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.94,0:12:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.22,0:12:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Franky wants to talk to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got something big to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.94,0:12:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long night, but they\Nfinished his ship of dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.18,0:12:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And boy is it super cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.90,0:12:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it's done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was really fast! Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.42,0:13:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when the best shipwrights\Nin the world work around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.02,0:13:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.72,0:13:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, we just found\Nout about this ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.90,0:13:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen the wanted posters?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanted posters?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a huge bounty\Non your head, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna hunt you down for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you've all got bounties!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole crew is wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took long enough? How much?\NNot me too! I want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No point in talking, just look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.68,0:13:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanted posters for all seven of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.88,0:13:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy with a bounty\Nof 300 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, it went up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirate Hunter Zoro with a\Nbounty of 120 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cat Burglar Nami with a\Nbounty of 16 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cotton Candy Lovin' Chopper,\NPet, with a bounty of 50 berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.40,0:14:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,50?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.66,0:14:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon Child Robin with a\Nbounty of 80 million berries
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.86,0:14:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black Leg Sanji, attempt to take a\Nphoto, failed Bounty, 77 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.06,0:14:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, Sniper King\Nhas one too, only 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I know that this is\Nprobably big news for you and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure there's a lot of\Npirate stuff you want to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, uh, hold on a sec, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came here because I got\Na favor to ask of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:14:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cyborg Franky with a bounty\Nof 44 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bro's wanted by the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was happy when I found\Nout we didn't have bounties.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.52,0:15:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then this had to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the whole\Ncity knows about our bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't stay in Water 7 anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.78,0:15:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if he gets arrested again,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think we'll have the power\Nto save him like we did last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.18,0:15:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure he worried about us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing him, he probably wouldn't leave the\Nisland no matter how much we begged him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we came to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.12,0:15:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're begging you here, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he tries to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta take our bro\Nout to sea with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His parents were pirates\NIt's in his blood!

